    ========================================== -->
    <section class="af-model-section">

        <div class="af-model-text">

            <span class="af-section-label">
                OUR BUSINESS MODEL
            </span>

            <h2>
                Simple &amp; Transparent Subscription Model
            </h2>

            <p>
                Afseem follows a
                <strong>subscription-based merchant model.</strong>
            </p>

            <p>
                Unlike traditional marketplace models that may charge
                merchants a commission on every order, Afseem is designed
                to provide participating merchants with access to its
                platform through an agreed subscription arrangement.
            </p>

            <p>
                Under the applicable merchant agreement, merchants may pay
                a fixed subscription fee for access to the services
                provided by Afseem.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="af-model-card">

            <div class="af-model-icon">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i>
            </div>

            <h3>Why Subscription?</h3>

            <p>
                Our objective is to create a transparent and sustainable
                model that allows local businesses to benefit from digital
                commerce without necessarily giving up a percentage of
                every customer order.
            </p>

            <div class="af-model-point">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                Transparent pricing
            </div>

            <div class="af-model-point">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                Predictable merchant costs
            </div>

            <div class="af-model-point">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                No automatic commission per order
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


